Regional Market Insights
•	Asia-Pacific: Commands over 60% of global PCB production, anchored by China's massive manufacturing ecosystem. The Pearl River Delta region alone accounts for 40% of China's PCB capacity, leveraging integrated supply chains and government support under the "Made in China 2025" initiative.
•	North America: Focused on high-value aerospace, defense, and automotive applications, with reshoring initiatives reducing reliance on Asian imports for critical infrastructure needs.
•	Europe: Maintains strength in automotive and industrial applications, with German manufacturers leading in quality-focused solutions and sustainable production methods.
•	Latin America/Middle East/Africa: These developing regions show accelerating growth potential as local electronics manufacturing capabilities expand, though currently remain import-dependent for most PCB requirements.
